<title>NAMIBIA: SOCCER-CAMEROON BEAT NAMIBIA 1-0 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CAMEROON BEAT NAMIBIA 1-0 IN AFRICAN NATIONS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>WINDHOEK 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of an African Nations</p>
<p>Cup group five qualifier on Saturday:</p>
<p>Namibia 0 Cameroon 1 (halftime 0-1)</p>
<p>Scorer: Joseph Tchango 69</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,000</p>
<p>Standings  P  W  D  L  F  A PTS</p>
<p> Cameroon    5  2  3  0  7  2  9</p>
<p> Namibia     5  2  1  2  3  6  7</p>
<p> Kenya	 4  1  1  2  1  2  4</p>
<p> Gabon	 4  0  3  1  3  4  3</p>
